OL,3,GNEWSASchool spent thousands on New York
OL,4,Atrip and alcohol
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school in Nottingham breached
OL,7,Fnumerous rules when it spent more than
OL,8,F#36,000 on a trip to New York and used
OL,9,Fmore than #1,200 on alcohol for an
OL,10,Fevent, an investigation has found.
OL,12,FStone Soup Academy - a single academy
OL,13,Ftrust for pupils not in mainstream
OL,14,Feducation - was investigated by the
OL,15,FDepartment for Education (DfE) after
OL,16,Fconcerns were raised about its
OL,17,Ffinances.
OL,19,FThe investigation, which began in 2025,
OL,20,Falso found a head teacher had been
OL,21,Fgiven a 13.7% pay rise without proper
OL,22,Fscrutiny or rationale.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
