OL,5,
OL,6,FSchool founder Chris Manze, who
OL,7,Freturned as principal in July, said
OL,8,Finternal controls had been
OL,9,F"strengthened" and the trust was
OL,10,Fworking closely with the DfE to ensure
OL,11,Fcompliance.
